Secondary node becomes new primary (failover).

🔵 50. How to secure MongoDB?

Use authentication

Enable IP whitelisting

Use environment variables

Use MongoDB Atlas

🔵 51. What is a cursor?

Result of a query before converting to array.

🔵 52. What is GridFS?

